{"step_index":5740,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T20:07:44Z","thinking":"The comparison of `PROC-009` and `PROC-011` is underway to understand the items' inclusion in the review sheet. The initial finding reveals a pairing issue: `كلاريتين اقراص س ج` (Claritin, an antihistamine) was incorrectly associated with `ترايكيتين اقراص س.ج ٤٦ج` (Triactin, another antihistamine and appetite stimulant).\n\n\nFurther investigation reveals numerous drug pairings in `PROC-009` flagged for review due to a loose threshold, despite significant differences in active ingredients and brand names. These mismatches, absent from the later process, are now categorized as \"Not Found\" in `PROC-011` due to the model recognizing that these are not the same commercial products. The observed behavior points to a refined matching process in the later procedure, successfully distinguishing between identical and non-identical drug products.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Deep dive script analyzing the fate of old review items\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"import sys\\nsys.path.insert(0, \\\".\\\")\\nimport openpyxl\\n\\nwb_old = openpyxl.load_workbook('data/processes/PROC-009/results_PROC-009.xlsx')\\nwb_new = openpyxl.load_workbook('data/processes/PROC-011/results_PROC-011.xlsx')\\n\\nws_rev_old = wb_old['يحتاج مراجعة']\\nold_rows = list(ws_rev_old.rows)[1:]\\n\\n# Load new matches\\nnew_matches = {}\\nfor s in wb_new.sheetnames:\\n    if s in ['ملخص', 'لم يُعثر عليه', 'يحتاج مراجعة']:\\n        continue\\n    for r in list(wb_new[s].rows)[1:]:\\n        req = str(r[0].value or '').strip()\\n        wh = str(r[1].value or '').strip()\\n        if req:\\n            new_matches[req] = (wh, s)\\n\\n# Load new review\\nnew_reviews = {}\\nfor r in list(wb_new['يحتاج مراجعة'].rows)[1:]:\\n    req = str(r[1].value or '').strip()\\n    cand = str(r[2].value or '').strip()\\n    wh = str(r[3].value or '').strip()\\n    reason = str(r[4].value or '').strip()\\n    if req:\\n        new_reviews[req] = (cand, wh, reason)\\n\\n# Categorize old rows\\nmatched_samples = []\\nstayed_rev_samples = []\\nrejected_strength_conflict = []\\nrejected_different_drug = []\\n\\nfrom src.fast_match.coordinator import get_strength_pattern\\n\\nfor r in old_rows:\\n    req = str(r[1].value or '').strip()\\n    cand = str(r[2].value or '').strip()\\n    wh = str(r[3].value or '').strip()\\n    \\n    if req in new_matches:\\n        matched_samples.append((req, cand, new_matches[req]))\\n    elif req in new_reviews:\\n        stayed_rev_samples.append((req, cand, new_reviews[req]))\\n    else:\\n        s_req = get_strength_pattern(req)\\n        s_cand = get_strength_pattern(cand)\\n        if s_req and s_cand and s_req != s_cand:\\n            rejected_strength_conflict.append((req, cand, s_req, s_cand))\\n        else:\\n            rejected_different_drug.append((req, cand))\\n\\nprint(f\\\"Total old review items analyzed: {len(old_rows)}\\\")\\nprint(f\\\"1. Items now confirmed MATCHED in PROC-011: {len(matched_samples)}\\\")\\nfor req, cand, match in matched_samples[:8]:\\n    print(f\\\"   * Req: '{req}'\\\")\\\n<truncated 937 bytes>","Description":"\"Analyze fate of old review items\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\kakak\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\\\scratch\\\\deep_fate_analysis.py\"","toolAction":"\"Writing deep fate analysis script\"","toolSummary":"\"Write deep_fate_analysis.py\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
